<main class="shell-main">
<h1>Shopping</h1>
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="new-item">
<h2 id="new-item">Add an Item</h2>
<form class="entry-form" method="post" action="/shopping" hx-post="/shopping" hx-swap="outerHTML">
<div class="field">
<label for="item-name">What's needed</label>
<input id="item-name" type="text" name="name" value="" required maxlength="200" autocomplete="off">
</div>
<fieldset class="field urgency-choice">
<legend>How soon</legend>
<div class="urgency-options">
<label class="urgency-option">
<input type="radio" name="urgency" value="asap">ASAP</label>
<label class="urgency-option">
<input type="radio" name="urgency" value="next-brewday" checked>Next brewday</label>
<label class="urgency-option">
<input type="radio" name="urgency" value="nice-to-have">Nice to have</label>
</div>
</fieldset>
<details class="field item-note-field">
<summary>Add a note</summary>
<label for="item-note">Note <span class="optional">(optional)</span>
</label>
<textarea id="item-note" name="note" rows="3" maxlength="500">
</textarea>
</details>
<button class="button large" type="submit">Add Item</button>
</form>
</section>
<div id="open-items">
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="urgency-asap">
<h2 id="urgency-asap">ASAP</h2>
<ul class="item-list">
<li class="item" id="item-6">
<div class="item-main">
<span class="item-name" id="item-6-name">Mangrove Jack's Bavarian Wheat yeast, or any other dry wheat yeast if they don't have it Mangrove Jack's Bavarian Wheat yeast, or any other dry wheat yeast if they don't have it</span>
<p class="item-note">Ask at the counter whether they can order more for next month. Ask at the counter whether they can order more for next month. Ask at the counter whether they can order more for next month. Ask at the counter whether they can order more for next month. Ask at the counter whether they can order more for next month. Ask at the counter whether they can order more for next month. Ask at the counter whether they can order more for next month.</p>
<span class="item-meta">
<time datetime="2026-10-24T09:30">Saturday 24 October 2026, 09:30</time> · Šimon</span>
</div>
<div class="item-actions">
<a class="button small secondary" href="/shopping/6/edit" hx-get="/shopping/6/edit" hx-target="#item-6" hx-swap="outerHTML" aria-describedby="item-6-name">Edit</a>
<form method="post" action="/shopping/6/bought" hx-post="/shopping/6/bought" hx-target="#open-items" hx-swap="outerHTML">
<button class="button small secondary" type="submit" aria-describedby="item-6-name">Bought</button>
</form>
</div>
</li>
</ul>
</section>
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="urgency-nice-to-have">
<h2 id="urgency-nice-to-have">Nice to have</h2>
<ul class="item-list">
<li class="item" id="item-7">
<div class="item-main">
<span class="item-name" id="item-7-name">Dezinfekčnípřípravekprorozlévárnupiva</span>
<p class="item-note">
<a href="https://www.example.cz/a/very/long/address/that/goes/on/and/on/without/a/single/space/to/break/at" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://www.example.cz/a/very/long/address/that/goes/on/and/on/without/a/single/space/to/break/at</a>
</p>
<span class="item-meta">
<time datetime="2026-10-24T09:45">Saturday 24 October 2026, 09:45</time> · Josef</span>
</div>
<div class="item-actions">
